    "acip": "'DOD NA MI 'THAD PAR THAL, RNAG KHRAG LA SOGS PA'I DNGOS PO GSUM PO 'GAL BA'I PHYIR DANG , CHU YIN MIN GNYIS PO DE PHAN TSUN SPANGS 'GAL GYI DNGOS 'GAL YIN PA'I PHYIR,",
    "wylie": "'dod na mi 'thad par thal, rnag khrag la sogs pa'i dngos po gsum po 'gal ba'i phyir dang , chu yin min gnyis po de phan tshun spangs 'gal gyi dngos 'gal yin pa'i phyir",
    "english": "And if you try to agree to these absurdities, you are wrong, for the quality of being pus and blood is incompatible with the quality of being either one of the other two substances mentioned. Moreover, the quality of being water and the quality of not being water are directly incompatible in such a way that, if something exists and lacks one of these qualities, it must then possess the other.",
    "raw": "{\"course\": \"C05\", \"acip\": \"'DOD NA MI 'THAD PAR THAL, RNAG KHRAG LA SOGS PA'I DNGOS PO GSUM PO 'GAL BA'I PHYIR DANG , CHU YIN MIN GNYIS PO DE PHAN TSUN SPANGS 'GAL GYI DNGOS 'GAL YIN PA'I PHYIR,\", \"wylie\": \"'dod na mi 'thad par thal, rnag khrag la sogs pa'i dngos po gsum po 'gal ba'i phyir dang , chu yin min gnyis po de phan tshun spangs 'gal gyi dngos 'gal yin pa'i phyir\", \"english\": \"And if you try to agree to these absurdities, you are wrong, for the quality of being pus and blood is incompatible with the quality of being either one of the other two substances mentioned. Moreover, the quality of being water and the quality of not being water are directly incompatible in such a way that, if something exists and lacks one of these qualities, it must then possess the other.\"}"
